### Game Servers API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@userId = YOUR_USER_ID_HERE
@serverId = YOUR_SERVER_ID_HERE

### Get all servers for current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all servers for a specific user (requires admin or own user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get specific server
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get server provisioning status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stop a server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restart a server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a server
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get server health status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get server metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
